      "message": "\u003e BTW maybe it\u0027s a good idea to move is_pkvm_text_range() as a generic helper to memory.h where we have is_memory_range(), is_pvmfw_range() etc?\n\nOk\n\n\u003e I\u0027m not sure this BUG_ON is a very good idea. It assumes is_pkvm_text_range() will only ever be used by fix_host_mmu_pgstate_walker()?\n\nOk, I will drop it.",
