      "writtenOn": "2026-10-20T12:24:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah I think it make sense - I\u0027ve switched to PKVM_PAGE_SHARED_BORROWED as suggested here (now it is actually `verify_host_mmu_pgstate_walker()` so check_ instead of set_ ) and also I\u0027ve started using PKVM_PAGE_SHARED_BORROWED in `host_mmu_map_ro()`",
      "parentUuid": "1daba37d_d0e12dff",
      "revId": "651d8890f177e183a9727fdc9abd3607ef45f8ff",
